== Description ==
Yields spell shards periodically based on pet level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] with spells cast; experience gained depends on the shard cost of the spells.

The Spellhound is universally used to [[Experience|level up]] more easily, and to stack certain [[spells]] such as Ritual of Power.

== Pet Ability ==
Grants spell shards every 10 seconds equal to:
<br><math>L^{1.15} \times P \times 4</math>
<br>If over <math>10^7</math>:
<br><math>\left(L^{1.15} \times P \times 4 - 10^7\right)^{0.15} + 10^7</math>

where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Spellhound gains experience for each shard-based spell cast, equal to:
<br><math>(S \times 0.8 + F) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>S = \text{Spell Shard Cost}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

